[365.234878, "o", "   run_id  lot_id inspection_stage    defect_type severity location  ... units_tested  units_pass  units_rework  units_scrap  fp_yield_pct  notes\r\n3   R0001  LOT114          SUMMARY  yield_summary      NaN      NaN  ...          208       194.0          11.0          3.0         93.27    NaN\r\n7   R0002  LOT114          SUMMARY  yield_summary      NaN      NaN  ...           56        56.0           0.0          0.0        100.00    NaN\r\n11  R0003  LOT104          SUMMARY  yield_summary      NaN      NaN  ...           62        60.0           1.0          1.0         96.77    NaN\r\n13  R0004  LOT109          SUMMARY  yield_summary      NaN      NaN  ...           50        48.0           2.0          0.0         96.00    NaN\r\n19  R0005  LOT115          SUMMARY  yield_summary      NaN      NaN  ...          188       165.0          19.0          4.0         87.77    NaN\r\n\r\n[5 rows x 14 columns]\r\n\r\nRuns per board family:\r\n"]
